## 8. Conditional Formatting Support Measures

### February Highlight Color

```DAX
February Highlight Color =
VAR CurrentMonth =
    SELECTEDVALUE('clean_dim_dates'[month_name])
RETURN
IF(
    CurrentMonth = "February",
    "#FFF2CC",
    "#FFFFFF"
)
```

This measure was created to highlight February in the matrix visual. Since February 2023 was the highest-sales month, highlighting it helped guide the viewer’s attention to the key month in the story.

